 base64 key — no real auth is checked by the mock). Note the Storage Blob REST API returns XML (not JSON) for list/metadata operations (e.g. ListBlobsFlatSegmentResponse), so canned responses need XML bodies, not JSON. Expect the usual --initialize-at-build-time flags for org.slf4j.helpers.NOPLoggerFactory/SubstituteLoggerFactory and com.fasterxml.jackson.core.Base64Variant seen in sibling azure-core-http-netty-based tests; the normal native-image fix loop will surface and add these if missing.\",\n      \"risks\": [\n        \"azure-storage-internal-avro (used for blob change-feed/query features) pulls Apache Avro, which has had reflection-heavy native-image compatibility issues in other projects — if the generated test exercises change-feed/query APIs, extra native-image reflect-config may surface during the fix loop; this is a compile/run-fix concern, not a pre-setup blocker.\"\n      ],\n      \"applied_setup\": [],\n      \"input_evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"name\": \"issue\",\n          \"summary\": \"#10682 Support for com.azure:azure-storage-blob:12.29.0; label=library-new-request; body_chars=39\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"existing_tests\",\n          \"summary\": \"0 existing test file path(s) included\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"model\": \"sonnet\",\n      \"input_tokens_used\": 30,\n      \"output_tokens_used\": 9976\n    },\n    \"metrics\": {\n      \"input_tokens_used\": 357575,\n      \"cached_input_tokens_used\": 7153920,\n      \"output_tokens_used\": 38558,\n      \"iterations\": 10,\n      \"cost_usd\": 6.5216,\n      \"generated_loc\": 0,\n      \"tested_library_loc\": 0,\n      \"metadata_entries\": 0,\n      \"code_coverage_percent\": 0.0\n    },\n    \"artifacts\": {\n      \"metadata_file\": \"None\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n"}], "isError": false, "timestamp": 1791822895440}}
